  <div class="rules"><strong>Workshop fees</strong><span>One workshop: ₹300 · Both workshops: ₹500.</span><span>Bring your own laptop for hands-on workshops unless informed otherwise.</span><span>Workshop participation is a separate track; cross-participation with the Challenge or Showcase is not permitted.</span></div>
</ConclavePage>
